    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Your questions about the demos."
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Do I need an account to listen to a Caresse demo?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. This hub helps you choose a demo; each first phase plays on its dedicated page, with no account or email. Inside the app, anonymous mode needs no Caresse account. Purchases go through the App Store or Google Play and require an Apple or Google account."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What is the difference between these demos and a real Caresse session?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Demos are fixed excerpts with names and preferences already chosen, identical on every listen. In the app, AI creates a session using your own names or aliases, solo or duo mode and preferences, narrated by a synthetic voice. Creating it uses paid credits, without a subscription; repetitions or inconsistencies remain possible."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How long are the demos, and a real experience?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "The first phases on the dedicated pages run a little over four minutes: long enough to hear the voice, the ambience and the intensity level, without giving away a whole experience. The experiences they are taken from run 26 minutes for the gentle discovery, 32 minutes for the couple and 29 minutes for the solo. In the app, expect 25 to 35 minutes as a rule: length is not a setting, it depends on what Caresse comes up with on the day."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Are the demos available in French and Spanish?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. This page has a <a href=\"/demo/\">French version</a> and a <a href=\"/es/demo/\">Spanish version</a>, with the same scenarios recorded in each language and names adapted accordingly: James &amp; Emma in English, Mathieu &amp; Clara in French, Álvaro &amp; Marta in Spanish."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Do these demos contain explicit content?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "The first demo is set to the app's softest register; the other two are set to its most direct language level. They are guided fiction, audio only, with no visual content whatsoever. Adults 18+ only, with headphones, somewhere you will not be interrupted."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can we listen to a couples demo from a single phone?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. The couples demo is a single narration addressed to both partners: one speaker, or a shared pair of headphones, is enough. In the app, the session says both first names and alternates between guiding one partner and the other."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
